{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: Price feed down (Day 33) | SPXC exit 48 days unreconciled", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Monday, October 12, 2026 — Kuwait time</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&amp;L</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #cbd5e1;\">N/A <span style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; font-weight: 400;\">— price feed down, Day 33</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Last confirmed (Oct 6, IBKR)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0;\">Net liq $535.17</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> ~$535 / $1,000 (last confirmed) — <span style=\"color:#cbd5e1;\">~$465 to go (~53.5% there)</span></p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">Both price feed (33 days) and portfolio.json's SPXC position (48 days) are now overdue for reconciliation — see Exit Alerts below.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- DECISIONS NEEDED -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #fef3c7; border-bottom: 1px solid #fde68a;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #92400e; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">⚠️ Decisions needed</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #78350f;\">SPXC: confirm the $205 exit-limit fill in IBKR and run portfolio-manager to close the position and sync cash — 48 calendar days overdue, purely mechanical at this point.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 6px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 18px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 600;\">🌍 Macro Context — Oct 12, 2026</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb; font-family: monospace;\">\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Buffett Indicator:</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">~234% <span style=\"background:#7f1d1d; color:#fecaca; border-radius:10px; padding:1px 8px; font-size:11px;\">🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">S&amp;P Forward P/E:</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">~19.0x <span style=\"color:#9ca3af;\">(vs. 5yr avg 19.8x)</span></td></tr>\n                    <tr><td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Trend:</td><td style=\"text-align:right;\">→ Roughly flat vs. last month</td></tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5;\">Market cap is still ~2.3× US GDP — every prior reading this high has preceded a multi-year drawdown. But forward P/E sitting slightly <em>below</em> its 5-year average (19x vs 19.8x) is a genuine divergence: earnings growth (~39% YoY H1 2026) has been outrunning price, so the \"expensive\" signal is coming almost entirely from the Buffett Indicator, not multiples.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5;\">For your strategy: this isn't a reason to add new risk on top of fast momentum trades — keep stops tight and don't let cash-deployment decisions assume the tape stays this forgiving.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">⚠️ No October reading found via search (sources cluster 229.7–237% from May–July 2026, no newer print located) — showing last reliably-sourced figure. Verify at currentmarketvaluation.com. Last historical episodes near this level: 2000 dot-com peak, 2021 bubble peak — see buffett-indicator-history.html.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION NEWS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 0 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #374151;\">📰 Position News</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6;\">No positions currently flagged <code>enhanced_news_watch</code> — GOOG and SPXC are both past their binary-catalyst phase (SPXC is exiting on the halal/defense rule, GOOG is a plain momentum hold). Nothing dedicated to scan for today.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT TABLE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Status</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Close</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Day</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&amp;L $</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&amp;L %</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n                    <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #fef3c7; color: #d97706; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">⚠️ WATCH</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">GOOG</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">⚠️ N/A</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">—</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n                    <span style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #ffedd5; color: #ea580c; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">🔔 ACTION</span>\n                  </td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">SPXC</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">⚠️ N/A</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color:#9ca3af;\">—</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 12px 8px; font-weight: 700;\">TOTAL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; color: #6b7280;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; color: #6b7280;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color:#9ca3af;\">N/A</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color:#9ca3af;\">N/A</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">Prices: Yahoo Finance JSON API (query1/query2) and stooq.com — all three returned DNS-level failures (getaddrinfo ENOTFOUND) as of this run. 33rd consecutive day with no live quote. Never estimated — see Position Detail below for the most recent triangulated references and their dates.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION DETAIL -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Detail</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px;\">\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">GOOG</span>\n                        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #fef3c7; color: #d97706; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">⚠️ WATCH</span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color:#9ca3af;\">~$344 <span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">(Oct 10–11 triangulated, unconfirmed)</span></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5;\">0.3 sh, entry $364.83. No live quote for 33 straight days (DNS-level block across every configured source). Best reference remains the ~$344 triangulation from last week, consistent since Oct 9 — still ~3% clear of the $333.90 stop, but that is not a confirmed quote. Earnings Oct 28 (16 trading days out) — not yet a hold/trim/exit decision point.</p>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280;\">Stop: <span style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">$333.90</span> (plain STOP, Abbas's choice)</td>\n                      <td style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #6b7280; text-align: right;\">TP1: <span style=\"color: #111827; font-weight: 600;\">$408</span> (GTC sell-limit live)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 14px 16px;\">\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\">SPXC</span>\n                        <span style=\"margin-left: 8px; padding: 2px 8px; background-color: #ffedd5; color: #ea580c; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;\">🔔 ACTION</span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color:#9ca3af;\">likely closed</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.5;\">Exiting on the defense-rule halal breach (Kranze Technology Solutions segment) since 2026-08-25 — now <strong>48 calendar days overdue</strong>. Two independent IBKR snapshots (Sep 29 and Oct 6, both via stock-finder) show only GOOG open with cash $432.16 — consistent with the $205 exit-limit having filled, not the $186.90 stop. This file still carries the position and the stale $330.60 cash figure because daily-portfolio-check doesn't write to portfolio.json (except education_tracker). <strong>Action:</strong> confirm the fill in IBKR, then run portfolio-manager to remove SPXC and set cash_available to ~$432.16.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈📉 Yesterday's Movers</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">No Friday Oct 9 data was found via search — most recent confirmed session is <strong>Thursday, Oct 8, 2026</strong>, shown below.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #065f46;\">Top Gainers — Oct 8, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:right; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">+%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Contagion</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">PCRX</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align:right; color:#059669;\">+44.4%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Viatris agreed to acquire Pacira BioSciences for $36.50/sh cash</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">M&amp;A</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">SAIQ</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align:right; color:#059669;\">+41.6%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">WISeSat.Space — no confirmed single catalyst found</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Unknown</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">PROF</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align:right; color:#059669;\">+21.7%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Profound Medical guided Q3 revenue $9.8-10.0M, above consensus</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Guidance</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #991b1b;\">Top Losers — Oct 8, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <tbody>\n                <tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; font-style:italic;\">No small-cap losers cleared the 20% threshold for Oct 8, 2026 (largest confirmed loser: AAOI −13.58%, below the filter).</td></tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE-CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Event</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Date</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Setup</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align:left; padding:6px 8px; color:#6b7280; border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Direction</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">TSLA</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Oct 21 (est.)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Delivery/margin questions post price cuts; date unconfirmed by IR</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">⚪ Neutral</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">GOOGL/META</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Oct 28 (est.)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Capex guide read-through matters more for your GOOG hold than the print itself</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">⚪ Neutral</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight:600;\">MSFT</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Oct 28 (est.)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Azure growth + capex trajectory; sources conflict on exact date</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding:6px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\">⚪ Neutral</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">All three dates are estimates from third-party calendars, not confirmed via company IR — treat as directional only. No 🟢 Bullish calls today, so no entry thesis prompts.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #fde68a; line-height: 1.6;\">All 5 tracked names (IQV, CELC, CAPR, VRDN, VERA) are archived — closed positions kept for lesson history, not live candidates. No active watchlist entries right now. New candidates come from <code>stock-finder</code> on demand, not this routine.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #166534; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">💵 Cash deployment</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #14532d; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    portfolio.json shows <strong>$330.60</strong> cash, but the two IBKR snapshots (Sep 29 &amp; Oct 6) put it at <strong>~$432.16</strong> once SPXC's exit is accounted for — see Exit Alerts. Deployable off the confirmed figure: ~$430 after the $2 commission reserve, well above the $30 minimum.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #14532d; line-height: 1.6;\">No fresh discovery candidate here by design — run <code>stock-finder</code> when you want new names to deploy into. <strong>Your call</strong> — but reconcile the file before sizing anything off it.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Deal-Certainty Discount</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    When an acquirer announces a cash deal — like Viatris agreeing to buy Pacira BioSciences today at $36.50/share — the target's stock jumps toward the offer price but almost never trades exactly at it before close. The gap is the \"deal-certainty discount\": compensation for the risk the deal breaks (antitrust, financing, shareholder vote) and for the time value of money until closing, often 6-12 months out. A 2-4% gap on a clean strategic cash deal with no antitrust overhang is normal; a gap of 8%+ signals the market thinks there's real break risk. This is the mechanic behind merger arbitrage (which you've seen before) — the discount IS the arb's return, annualized against the expected time to close. It's also why buying a stock after the acquisition announcement for the \"pop\" rarely works: almost all the move already happened in the gap-up, and what's left is a slow, low-volatility grind to the offer price.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: <em>Collar provisions</em> — some stock-for-stock M&A deals cap/floor the exchange ratio if the acquirer's share price moves too much before close, protecting the target from being underpaid in a falling-acquirer scenario.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\n              Prices: Yahoo Finance JSON API + stooq — all unreachable (DNS-level failure), Day 33. Positions priced \"N/A\" per policy, never estimated.\n              Returns method: last confirmed IBKR net liq (Oct 6, 2026), not live. Generated 2026-10-12 06:00 Kuwait time.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}